OL,3,GNEWSAPrison officer and inmate jailed
OL,4,Aover Snapchat fling
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former prison officer has been told
OL,7,Fshe could have caused "untold harm"
OL,8,Finside and outside the jail she worked
OL,9,Fat by sharing more than 5,000 illicit
OL,10,FSnapchat messages with an inmate.
OL,12,FJade Morris, who sent messages to
OL,13,Fconvicted drug dealer Jerome Nunes'
OL,14,F"contraband" mobile phone during a
OL,15,Fsecret fling, was jailed for 12 months
OL,16,Fon Friday at Birmingham Crown Court.
OL,18,FNunes, who was freed from a previous
OL,19,Fsentence almost two years ago, was
OL,20,Fjailed for nine months after being told
OL,21,Fhe had "abused" his relationship with
OL,22,FMorris.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
